## Third-party components and attributions

AirPad integrates protocol knowledge and code derived from the following
open-source projects (all retrieved in September 2026). Their licenses apply
to their respective parts:

- SteeBono/airplayreceiver (MIT) — original C# AirPlay 2 mirroring/audio
  protocol implementation. The binary-plist codec, RTSP models, FairPlay
  (OmgHax) key routine and handshake flow in AirPad.Core are adapted from it.
- UxPlay by FDH2 (GPL-3.0, https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay) — used ONLY as a
  protocol reference (handshake order, TXT records, mirror framing). No UxPlay
  source code is copied into this repository.
- RPiPlay / shairport-sync / playfair authors — protocol pioneers; referenced
  for documentation purposes only.
- mstorsjo/fdk-aac, FFmpeg, NAudio, Makaretu.Dns, BouncyCastle — used as
  external libraries under their own licenses (see dependency list in README).

AirPlay is a trademark of Apple Inc. This project is an independent
interoperability implementation, not affiliated with or endorsed by Apple.
DRM-protected content (FairPlay video) is not decrypted and cannot be mirrored.
